<title>USA: TB Wood's acquires brake manufacturer.</title>
<headline>TB Wood's acquires brake manufacturer.</headline>
<dateline>CHAMBERSBURG, Pa. 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>TB Wood's Corp said Monday that one of its subsidiary, TB Wood's Inc, has acquired the assets of Ambi-Tech Industries Inc, a manufacturer of brakes for electric motors.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>TB Wood's President M.L. Hurt said in a statement that the acquisition &quot;provides immediate and long term earnings growth potential.&quot;</p>
<p>Hurt added that Ambi-Tech's business complements TB Wood's electronic motor controls.</p>
<p>Ambi-Tech is based in Hillsdale, N.J.</p>
</text>
